{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"erfei-e-o028","title":"刘禅策立张氏为皇后","accounts":[{"id":"erfei-a-86f90c3e132f541a2a56","label":"正文","text":"刘禅策立张氏为皇后","evidence":["erfei-q-a439f0801272a0726186","erfei-q2-b6c16f582166fd9ee0c7"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0112","role":"延熙元年春正月策立张氏为皇后","evidence":["erfei-q-a439f0801272a0726186"]},{"person":"liuliao-p0019","role":"以行丞相事、左将军持节授皇后玺绶","evidence":["erfei-q-a439f0801272a0726186"]},{"person":"erfei-p0010","role":"被策立为皇后","evidence":["erfei-q-a439f0801272a0726186"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["erfei-q-a439f0801272a0726186"]},"ordering_evidence":"erfei-q-a439f0801272a0726186","source_order":[34,54,25],"order":6727}],"persons":[{"id":"erfei-p0010","name":"张氏（刘禅张皇后）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liuliao-p0019","name":"向朗","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0112","name":"刘禅","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"erfei-q-a439f0801272a0726186","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-b00e4a0b53c2891dee6b","layer":"original","quote":"延熙元年春正月，策曰","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"erfei-q2-b6c16f582166fd9ee0c7","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-b00e4a0b53c2891dee6b","layer":"original","quote":"后主张皇后，前后敬哀之妹也。建兴十五年，入为贵人。延熙元年春正月，策曰：“朕统承大业，君临天下，奉郊庙、社稷。今以贵人为皇后。使行丞相事、左将军（向）朗〖1〗，持节，授玺绶。勉修中馈〖2〗，恪肃禋祀〖3〗。皇后其敬之哉！”","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
